      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COHEN THE RED (8) is a progressive gelding who had enough speed to lead from a similar draw to this before going on to score by 6.6m at this circuit and distance last time. That was his third win from just four outings. Can deliver again. THIS IS HEAVEN (5) drops in grade off a Vicbred Super Series semi-final at Melton. Runner-up in a heat of that series prior and went under by narrow margins in the previous two outings so he has looked close to a win for a while. Could achieve it here. FRIZZA (6) raced just once last campaign when beaten less than 2m here in June. Won the other two times he was fresh and should be ready to go off three nice trials. AURORA MIGHTY ROB (7) placed here last week and while drawn wider should be reaching peak fitness now.",
